{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you\u2019re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 3 others as you infiltrate abandoned facilities, now overrun and crawling with danger, to complete high-risk objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary and Blood-Thirsty Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, sound and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission in Deathground is a tense encounter where every decision matters. Procedurally generated elements, dynamic objectives and reactive enemy AI create a fresh, high-stakes challenge with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth, combat, teamwork and a range of specialist tools to adapt, outsmart your predators and make it to extraction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with up to 3 other players and manage specialist items such as the Motion Detector, Tranquilizer Rifle, Hacking Device or Medkit, each offering unique tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deadly threats lurking in every shadow, teamwork and cooperation can mean the difference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session, if you dare. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a range of abandoned, decaying research facilities, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. These environments are designed to build tension and challenge your survival instincts at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1200770?t=1758375728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/bc085b4a755cb764a8078e3eadaa22d67463fb75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758375728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/5705e9a80e5b48925ee95044e465b13cafe1897a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758375728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/5705e9a80e5b48925ee95044e465b13cafe1897a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758375728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mild but frequent depictions of violence, blood and gore. Players can expect tense situations designed to evoke fear, encounters with dinosaurs and sudden jumpscares. The horror themes are intended for mature audiences.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts or drug and alcohol abuse."},"detailed_description":"<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST DEATHGROUND!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Deathground to your wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The best thing you can do to support us is wishlist the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help boost the game's visibility on Steam with just a click, it'll also ensure that you get notified as soon as we release. We appreciate your support!</p></p><br><h1>GET EARLY DEVELOPMENT UPDATES ON DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/d1e78fe70a1c63583aeb3b309cb5d2e2.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=112 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our Discord Server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get regular sneak peeks and behind-the-scenes of Deathground's development, chat with our community and feedback on the game. You never know, you might find your future squad mates there.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you\u2019re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with up to 3 others as you infiltrate abandoned facilities, now overrun and crawling with danger, to complete high-risk objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary and Blood-Thirsty Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, sound and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission in Deathground is a tense encounter where every decision matters. Procedurally generated elements, dynamic objectives and reactive enemy AI create a fresh, high-stakes challenge with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth, combat, teamwork and a range of specialist tools to adapt, outsmart your predators and make it to extraction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with up to 3 other players and manage specialist items such as the Motion Detector, Tranquilizer Rifle, Hacking Device or Medkit, each offering unique tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deadly threats lurking in every shadow, teamwork and cooperation can mean the difference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session, if you dare. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a range of abandoned, decaying research facilities, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. These environments are designed to build tension and challenge your survival instincts at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.poster.avif?t=1758375728\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.webm?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.mp4?t=1758375728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>","developers":["Jaw Drop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/ab1101f4d933f3fa6a15439a217b7f24edfb43ac/header.jpg?t=1758375728","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Jaw Drop Games 2025. All Rights Reserved. <br />\r\nDeathground and Jaw Drop Games logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Jaw Drop Games Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117194,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie480.mp4?t=1742558739","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie_max.mp4?t=1742558739"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117194/5fb951d0254d6d0aca6fe2be5be9280b15582310/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742558739","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742558739","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742558739"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257158235,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158235/movie480.mp4?t=1750245003","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158235/movie_max.mp4?t=1750245003"},"name":"Developer Overview Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158235/bfbeb25853e200d4b36b05bdc69b81b366fdcbe0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750245003","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158235/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750245003","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai